  "notes": [
    "Each entry represents one hit unless stated otherwise. Trigger availability and buff duration are combat snapshots, not a rotation simulation.",
    "Punches and the final kick are Burst damage, not Normal Attack damage. Roaring Barrage changes punch timing and is not an additional damage instance.",
    "Skill casts scale with ATK at C0; field attacks and Burst hits use mixed ATK/HP scaling. C1 adds HP scaling to all three Skill stages and both Burst hit types.",
    "Entries are independent snapshots outside/during Burst. The field is retrieved during Burst, so field ticks and punches are not simultaneous rotation events. Damage transfer, shield/defensive effects and healing are not outgoing damage."
  ],
